  "body": "• Character home moments from Orewa Beach\r\n• Peaceful position at the sought-after northern end of the beach\r\n• Four bedrooms, two bathrooms and flexible living options\r\n• Ocean views from the upper level and deck\r\n• Courtyard garden for outdoor entertaining\r\n• Internal access garage and separate laundry\r\n• Easy walk to Orewa township, cafés and restaurants\r\n\r\nJust a stone's throw from the sands of Orewa Beach, this charming home enjoys a privileged position at the quieter northern end of the coastline.\r\n\r\nFilled with warmth and character, the versatile layout offers relaxed coastal living across two levels. Downstairs, the inviting open-plan living, kitchen and dining area forms the heart of the home, flowing to a private courtyard garden. Also on this level is a generous bedroom complete with a large walk-in wardrobe, family bathroom, internal access garage, laundry, and glimpses towards the ocean.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, you'll find three further bedrooms and a second family bathroom. The rear bedroom is particularly special, capturing lovely sea views and opening onto an elevated deck where you can soak in the view across the beach and ocean. This flexible space could easily serve as a second living area, media room, or an inspiring work-from-home retreat.\r\n\r\nWith a welcoming feel throughout and a location that's hard to beat, you'll love being able to stroll to Orewa's vibrant cafés, restaurants, shops and amenities, while excellent transport links provide an easy commute to Auckland City.\r\n\r\nWhether you're searching for a permanent residence, beachside family home, or a coastal retreat, this is a property that truly embraces the best of the Orewa lifestyle.",
